5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to see if we can actually finish on time! I'll check regional firms tendering for earth-moving and depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I'm worried about how the park is actually used. I'll look into timed counts of weekday crossings and drainage callouts and August heat readings.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I wonder who will take care of the park every day. I'll check the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services and volunteer groups working with the division.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I want to see if the previous work actually lasted. I'll examine the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about the long-term costs. I will review the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the terms of the regional habitat fund.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
